---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const articleSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      "headline": "Flats Near Pune Metro Line 3 Hinjewadi-Shivajinagar: Stations, Impact & Best Projects",
      "description": "Comprehensive guide to Pune Metro Line 3 impact on real estate. Discover station alignments, 23 km route, travel time reductions, and top residential developments near Balewadi Stadium & Hinjewadi stations.",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Pune Real Estate Research Desk"
      },
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Mahindra Rivenza"
      },
      "datePublished": "2026-10-09",
      "dateModified": "2026-10-10"
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout
  title="Flats Near Pune Metro Line 3 | Hinjewadi-Shivajinagar Route"
  description="Guide to residential properties along Pune Metro Line 3. Route map, Balewadi & Hinjewadi stations, price appreciation & flats at Mahindra Rivenza Baner Annex."
  canonical="https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/flats-near-pune-metro-line-3/"
  customSchema={articleSchema}
>
  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-charcoal-950 text-stone-300">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10">
      
      <div class="space-y-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs text-gold-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">
          <a href="/articles/" class="hover:underline">← All Research</a>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Transit Infrastructure</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>October 2026</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-stone-100 leading-tight">
          Pune Metro Line 3 (Hinjewadi to Shivajinagar): Station Alignments &amp; Real Estate Impact
        </h1>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-stone-400 font-light leading-relaxed">
          The 23.3-kilometer elevated Pune Metro Line 3 connects the massive employment engine of Hinjewadi IT Park to Central Pune’s Shivajinagar. Here is how this transit corridor is reshaping residential valuations across West Pune.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Sections -->
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">1. Key Route Alignments &amp; Stations</h2>
        <p>
          Line 3 features 23 elevated stations, directly connecting Hinjewadi Phase 3 (Megapolis), Phase 2 (Wipro), Phase 1 (Infosys), Wakad Chowk, Balewadi Stadium, Baner, Pune University, and Shivajinagar.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">2. Proximity Advantage for Mahindra Rivenza Baner Annex</h2>
        <p>
          Located at Mahalunge (Baner Annex), <strong>Mahindra Rivenza</strong> is positioned between two major Metro Line 3 nodes:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Balewadi Stadium Station:</strong> Only 3.2 km (6 minutes), providing signal-free transit into Baner, Aundh, and Central Pune.</li>
          <li><strong>Hinjewadi Phase 1 / Shivaji Chowk Station:</strong> Just 3.8 km (7 minutes), enabling swift commutes across the IT cluster.</li>
          <li><strong>PMRDA Feeder Transit:</strong> Wide 36m Town Planning roads incorporate designated feeder bus and e-shuttle loops directly connecting the township to metro boarding points.</li>
        </ul>

      </div>

      <!-- Lead Advisory Card -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-charcoal-900 via-charcoal-800 to-charcoal-900 border border-gold-500/30 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="space-y-1 text-center sm:text-left">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white">Explore Transit-Connected Residences</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-300">Learn how Pune Metro Line 3 will cut your daily commute by over 60%.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <a href="tel:+917744009295" class="px-5 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-400 text-charcoal-950 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors">
            Call: +91 7744009295
          </a>
          <a href="/location/" class="px-5 py-3 rounded-lg bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 border border-white/20 text-white text-xs font-semibold transition-colors">
            View Location Map
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
